-- Reading a list by position: the default is invisible inside the list,
-- positions mirror under reversal, the last entry of a snoc, and
-- extensionality by positions in both directions
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
